<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Maaz Ali - Premium Resume</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4;
            margin: 8mm;
            background-color: #030712;
        }
        
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #030712;
            color: #f3f4f6;
            font-size: 8.5pt;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .layout-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        /* Left Side Panel - Sleek and structured */
        .sidebar-cell {
            width: 30%;
            background-color: #0b0f19; 
            padding: 18px 12px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #1f2937;
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        /* Right Side Main Content */
        .main-cell {
            width: 70%;
            padding-left: 20px;
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        /* Headshot Styling */
        .profile-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .profile-img {
            width: 115px;
            height: 115px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 3px solid #818cf8;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #111827;
        }

        /* Headers & Sections */
        .header-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b0f19 0%, #111827 100%);
            border: 1px solid #1f2937;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .name {
            font-size: 21pt;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 11pt;
            color: #a78bfa; 
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin: 4px 0 10px 0;
        }

        .summary-text {
            font-size: 8.2pt;
            color: #9ca3af;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 10.5pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-top: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.2px;
            border-left: 4px solid #a78bfa;
            padding-left: 8px;
        }

        .sidebar-title {
            font-size: 8.5pt;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.2px;
            color: #c084fc; 
            border-bottom: 1px solid #374151;
            padding-bottom: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Contact Items */
        .contact-item {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 7.8pt;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }

        .contact-item strong {
            color: #e2e8f0;
            display: block;
            font-size: 7.5pt;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .contact-item a {
            color: #818cf8;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* Skills Tags */
        .skill-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #111827;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            padding: 3px 6px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 2px 1.5px;
            font-size: 7.2pt;
            border: 1px solid #374151;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* Cards Layout */
        .card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b0f19 0%, #0f172a 100%);
            border: 1px solid #1f2937;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card-header {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 9.5pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .card-right {
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 7.8pt;
            color: #818cf8;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .card-right a {
            color: #818cf8;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .card-subtitle {
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .card-list {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 12px;
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 8pt;
        }

        .card-list li {
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        /* Education Layout */
        .edu-box {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .edu-title {
            font-size: 8.2pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #f3f4f6;
        }

        .edu-detail {
            font-size: 7.5pt;
            color: #9ca3af;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .edu-date {
            font-size: 7.5pt;
            color: #818cf8;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 1px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <table class="layout-table">
        <tr>
            <!-- Left Sidebar Section -->
            <td class="sidebar-cell">
                <div class="profile-container">
                    <!-- Aapki image yahan se load hogi -->
                    <img class="profile-img" src="user.png" alt="Maaz Ali">
                </div>

                <div class="sidebar-section" style="margin-top: 10px;">
                    <div class="sidebar-title">Contact Directory</div>
                    <div class="contact-item">
                        <strong>Email Address</strong>
                        <a href="mailto:maazjan.dev@gmail.com">maazjan.dev@gmail.com</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="contact-item">
                        <strong>Digital Hub</strong>
                        <a href="https://maazali091.github.io" target="_blank">maazali091.github.io</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="contact-item">
                        <strong>GitHub Engine</strong>
                        <a href="https://github.com/maazali091" target="_blank">github.com/maazali091</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="contact-item">
                        <strong>Location</strong>
                        Peshawar, Pakistan
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="sidebar-section">
                    <div class="sidebar-title">Core Engine</div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="skill-tag">React.js</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag">JavaScript (ES6+)</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag">Tailwind CSS</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag">HTML5 / CSS3</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag">Node.js</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag">Git & GitHub</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag">Responsive UI Engineering</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag">REST APIs</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="sidebar-section">
                    <div class="sidebar-title">Education</div>
                    <div class="edu-box">
                        <div class="edu-title">Fsc Computer Science</div>
                        <div class="edu-detail">Al-Muslim College CHD</div>
                        <div class="edu-date">2023</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="sidebar-section">
                    <div class="sidebar-title">Interests</div>
                    <div class="contact-item" style="color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.4;">
                        High-Performance Web Render Engines, UI Animation Frameworks, Open Source Projects.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </td>

            <!-- Right Main Content Section -->
            <td class="main-cell">
                <!-- Glowing Premium Header Box -->
                <div class="header-box">
                    <h1 class="name">Maaz Ali</h1>
                    <div class="title">Frontend Web Developer</div>
                    <p class="summary-text">
                        Passionate Frontend Web Developer and BSCS student specializing in building high-fidelity, lightning-fast web applications. Focused on engineering responsive, fluid, and robust user interfaces using React and Tailwind CSS while ensuring clean architecture, semantic code, and top-tier page performance optimizations.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="section-title">Engineered Projects</div>

                <!-- Project 1 -->
                <div class="card">
                    <table class="card-header">
                        <tr>
                            <td class="card-title">PPC Growth Lab</td>
                            <td class="card-right"><a href="https://ppcgrowthlab.com" target="_blank">ppcgrowthlab.com &nearr;</a></td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                    <div class="card-subtitle">Live Client Production Build (React & Tailwind CSS)</div>
                    <ul class="card-list">
                        <li>Designed and engineered a modular corporate interface for an Amazon PPC Management agency.</li>
                        <li>Configured and registered custom secure domain properties with optimized DNS routing.</li>
                        <li>Identified, analyzed, and successfully resolved canonical redirect flags in Google Search Console.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Project 2 -->
                <div class="card">
                    <table class="card-header">
                        <tr>
                            <td class="card-title">Personal Developer Portfolio Hub</td>
                            <td class="card-right"><a href="https://maazali091.github.io" target="_blank">maazali091.github.io &nearr;</a></td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                    <div class="card-subtitle">Production Dashboard & UI Laboratory (React)</div>
                    <ul class="card-list">
                        <li>Crafted a sleek, neon-inspired tech portfolio utilizing highly optimized modular component states.</li>
                        <li>Built and maintained automated compilation scripts deployed seamlessly via GitHub Pages.</li>
                        <li>Achieved solid 95+ scores on Lighthouse performance, accessibility, and SEO metrics.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="section-title">Industry Experience</div>

                <!-- Experience -->
                <div class="card">
                    <table class="card-header">
                        <tr>
                            <td class="card-title">Freelance Frontend Developer</td>
                            <td class="card-right" style="color: #cbd5e1; font-weight: 600;">2025 - PRESENT</td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                    <div class="card-subtitle">Global Client Base</div>
                    <ul class="card-list">
                        <li>Translating complex UI/UX designs into pixel-perfect, highly fluid and semantic HTML/CSS structures.</li>
                        <li>Refining and optimizing outdated codebases to utilize rapid Tailwind utilities and React hooks.</li>
                        <li>Managing clean Git architectures and collaborating directly with clients to meet performance targets.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="section-title">Core Development Standards</div>
                <div style="font-size: 7.8pt; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.5; padding-left: 5px;">
                    🎯 Mobile-First Responsive Frameworks &bull; ⚡ Highly Optimized React Hooks & Performance &bull; 🛠️ Systematic Version Control with Git/GitHub &bull; 🔍 Advanced SEO & Page-Speed Lighthouse Auditing &bull; 🎨 Semantic and Scalable Component Architecture
                </div>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

</body>
</html>